'''Oriana''' is a thoughtful thief located just outside the western bank in [[Civitas illa Fortis]]. She is involved in the [[stealing valuables]] activity, buying [[valuables]] that have been looted from [[Lavinia|Lavinia's]], [[Caius|Caius']], or [[Victor (Civitas illa Fortis)|Victor's]] houses from the player for 55 [[coins]] each (or 65 coins each after earning [[Glory|Gladiator]] rank at the [[Fortis Colosseum]]). Before speaking to her, Oriana's name appears as '''Dodgy Character'''.

